# Testing

- Prefer behavior tests over brittle snapshots.
- Mock API modules; cover loading/empty/error/retry and language selector persistence.
- CreatureImage must cover missing/failed remote image fallback.
- Run `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, `npm test` (Node 22+).
